Symbols
-------
The SVG files in frontend/public/openmoji are emojis and icons designed by
OpenMoji, the open-source emoji and icon project (https://openmoji.org,
https://github.com/hfg-gmuend/openmoji).
License: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
The license text is in frontend/public/openmoji/LICENSE.txt.
The files are unchanged. A symbol that is edited stays under CC BY-SA 4.0.

