Sachunterricht line drawings
----------------------------
The SVG files in frontend/public/sachunterricht are original black line
drawings made for Blattomat. They are not taken from another picture set.

Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode).
The legal code, as read on 22 October 2026, is in
frontend/public/sachunterricht/LICENCE.txt.

CC0 1.0 waives copyright and related rights to the extent the law allows,
and where a waiver does not hold it grants a royalty-free licence that
includes commercial use (section 3, Public License Fallback). It does not
ask for credit. No drawing in the set asks for a credit on the sheet.
Each picture's source, author, licence and address are in
frontend/public/sachunterricht/pictures.json, beside the files.
